-op action survival game where players must band together to defeat the Nightlord. Teams of three (or solo players) must survive a three day-and-night cycle on changing maps, making split decisions about combat and exploration to grow stronger and face terrifying bosses at the end of each day. Every session is procedurally different — enemies, rewards and the realm of Limveld shift and evolve — and successful runs unlock greater weapons, Runes and narrative insight into each Hero, bringing players closer to defeating the Nightlord's realm.","developer":"From Software","external":{"metacritic":{"id":"1400806359"}},"image":{"url":"https://images.qloo.com/i/31457158-A538-4023-A8BF-26A188CD5E8E-420x-auto.jpg"},"platforms":["PlayStation 5","Xbox Series X","PC","PlayStation 4","Xbox One"],"publisher":"Bandai Namco Games","release_date":"2025-05-30","release_year":2025,"short_description":"Squads of up to three survive shifting maps and daily boss fights across a three-day cycle to overthrow the Nightlord and uncover each hero's past.","short_descriptions":[{"language":"de","value":"Spieler schließen sich zusammen, um in einer sich verändernden Welt zu überleben und den Nachtlord zu besiegen, während sie mächtige Waffen und Heldengeschichten entdecken."},{"language":"es","value":"Los jugadores se unen para sobrevivir en un mundo cambiante y derrotar al Señor de la Noche, descubriendo armas poderosas y las historias de héroes."},{"language":"fr","value":"Les joueurs s'unissent pour survivre dans un monde changeant et vaincre le Seigneur de la Nuit, découvrant des armes puissantes et les histoires des héros."},{"language":"en","value":"Players unite to survive a shifting world and defeat the Nightlord, uncovering powerful weapons and the stories of heroes."}]},"popularity":0.9629877904805931,"disambiguation":"2025-05-30, From Software","tags":[{"name":"3D","tag_id":"urn:tag:art_style:qloo:3d","type":"urn:tag:art_style:qloo"},{"name":"Realistic","tag_id":"urn:tag:art_style:ql